        "id": "nova.chunk.pm_092.0",
        "claim_type": "context",
        "document_id": "nova.doc.pm_092",
        "document_title": "Postmortem INC-092 payment connection pool exhaustion",
        "document_classification": "internal",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "source_ref": "synthetic://wiki/postmortems/092#chunk-0",
        "text_excerpt": "Summary: payment v2.3 exhausted its database connection pool. Checkout called payment, timed out and returned HTTP 5xx to customers at a 14 percent rate.\n\nWhat did not help: restarting checkout pods at 09:31Z. The fault was upstream in payment.\n\nResolution: the payments lead approved a rollback of payment to v2.2 at 09:52Z after pausing ledger reconciliation. Checkout 5xx returned to 0.3 percent by 10:00Z.\n\nFollow-up: alert on payment DB pool wait time; review connection pool sizing in every payment release.",
        "graph_links": [
          "Document nova.doc.pm_092 -[RELATES_TO]-> Service nova.svc.payment"
        ],
