        "id": "nova.chunk.adr_017.0",
        "claim_type": "context",
        "document_id": "nova.doc.adr_017",
        "document_title": "ADR-017 Payment rollbacks by on-call",
        "document_classification": "internal",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "source_ref": "synthetic://wiki/adr/017#chunk-0",
        "text_excerpt": "Status: superseded by ADR-031 on 2026-06-01.\n\nDecision: the payments on-call engineer may roll back a payment service deployment without further approval when checkout errors rise after a release.\n\nConsequence: fast mitigation, but ledger reconciliation was occasionally left running during rollbacks.",
